# Valuation

**Enterprise-to-equity bridge**

Net debt is deducted only after valuing operating cash flows. Basic and diluted equity values use the same enterprise valuation; no acquisition premium is included.

A high terminal contribution calls for particular scrutiny of sustainable margins and reinvestment, not just the selected discount rate.

